Conversion	Type	Method	Data Loss
int → double	Widening	automatic	❌ No
double → int	Narrowing	(int)	✅ Yes
int → String	Manual	valueOf()	❌ No
String → int	Manual	parseInt()	❌ (if valid)


class Main {
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    // create int type variable
    int num = 50;
    System.out.println("The integer value: " + num);
    // convert into double type
    double data = num;
    System.out.println("The double value: " + data);
  }
}

Output:
Integer value: 50
Double value: 50.0


2. Converting Double into an Int

class Main {
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    // create double type variable
    double num = 50.55;
    System.out.println("The double value: " + num);
    // convert into int type
    int data = (int)num;
    System.out.println("The integer value: " + data);
  }
}

Output:
Double value: 50.55
Integer value: 50


3. Converting Int to String

